      "name": "DeselectUnitAndUpdateUI",
      "signature": "undefined4 DeselectUnitAndUpdateUI(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Deselect active melee unit and player selection, refresh UI displays.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Decrement global melee unit count if positive\n2. Decrement global player select count if positive\n3. Update expansion unit display (viewport refresh)\n4. Update game UI state (selection indicators)\n5. Return success code\n\nParameters:\nNone\n\nReturns:\n1 (success code)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Gracefully handles zero counts with conditional checks\n- No error conditions\n\nGlobal Variables:\ng_dwMeleeUnitCount - Active melee unit selection count (uint)\ng_dwPlayerSelectCount - Active player selection count (uint)",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
