      "name": "InitializeBnetLoginUI",
      "signature": "undefined InitializeBnetLoginUI(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Initializes the Battle.net login user interface components.\n\nCreates and configures all UI elements needed for the login screen including\nbackground, interface container, login form, text boxes, and progress indicator.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call UI manager initialization\n2. Validate UI object count (assert if >= 64)\n3. Create background UI element from g_tBnetBackgroundConfig\n4. Create BnClient interface from g_tBnetInterfaceConfig, set image type to 3\n5. Create login form from g_tLoginFormConfig\n6. Query BnClient vtable for frame count, cap at 100\n7. Create login message text box from g_tLoginMessageBoxConfig\n8. Add text with string ID 0x143a to message box\n9. Create password text box from g_tPasswordBoxConfig  \n10. Add text with string ID 0x143b to password box\n11. Create progress indicator from g_tLoginProgressConfig\n12. Initialize cel frame animation with scaled frame count\n13. Format and display login status message\n\nParameters: None (void)\n\nReturns: void\n\nError Handling:\n- FogAssert called if UI object count exceeds limit of 64\n- Multiple assertion checks at lines 0x60d\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x40 (64): Maximum UI object count limit\n- 0x64 (100): Frame count cap for animation\n- 0x143a: String ID for login message\n- 0x143b: String ID for password prompt\n- 0x4c: Vtable offset for frame count query\n- 0x51eb851f: Scaling factor for frame calculation\n\nGlobal References:\n- g_tBnetBackgroundConfig (0x6fa92980): Background UI config\n- g_tBnetInterfaceConfig (0x6fa929b0): BnClient interface config\n- g_tLoginFormConfig (0x6fa928f0): Login form config\n- g_tLoginMessageBoxConfig (0x6fa92920): Message text box config\n- g_tPasswordBoxConfig (0x6fa928c0): Password text box config\n- g_tLoginProgressConfig (0x6fa929e0): Progress indicator config",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.09d",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:279c9ebdcbe82c155d296edc2cdef211f7330488e865f904d908aeb184e685ca",
