      "name": "CancelBnetLogin",
      "signature": "uint CancelBnetLogin(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Cancels an active Battle.net login session.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Invoke Battle.net client interface virtual function at offset 0x7c (typically Disconnect)\n2. Set global login cancellation flag (g_dwBnetLoginCancelled = 1)\n3. Finalize Battle.net disconnection sequence via FinalizeBnetDisconnect()\n4. Return success status (1)\n\nParameters:\n(none)\n\nReturns:\nuint - 1 (success)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Called to abort an in-progress login\n- Sets global flag before finalization to indicate user-initiated cancellation\n- Virtual function call allows polymorphic Battle.net client handling\n\nError Handling:\n- No error checking; assumes virtual function and FinalizeBnetDisconnect() succeed\n- Returns 1 unconditionally\n\nGlobal Dependencies:\n- g_pBnclientInterface: Battle.net client interface instance (polymorphic)\n- g_dwBnetLoginCancelled: Global flag set to indicate login cancellation\n- FinalizeBnetDisconnect(): Called for cleanup",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:1de0e51eb87f1b1f5b15229863985faf1b2de165a95bed2ede579c1eb106719d",
