      "name": "SynchronizeTextBlockCounters",
      "signature": "undefined SynchronizeTextBlockCounters(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Synchronizes three text block counters to a common size.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Retrieve initial sizes for three text blocks (A, B, C)\n2. If C < B: Insert default unit name into C until C >= B\n3. If B < C: Insert default unit name into B until B >= C\n4. If B < A: Insert default unit name into B and C until B >= A\n5. If A < B: Insert default unit name into A until A >= B\n6. Final synchronization: Insert default unit name into A, B, C (final pass)\n\nPurpose: Ensures all three text block collections contain matching element counts by expanding smaller blocks with default entries.\n\nParameters: None\n\nReturns: void\n\nNotes:\n- Uses repeated calls to ConvertStringToUnicode to add elements\n- GetTextBlockField58 retrieves current size of each block\n- Synchronization required for game text display consistency",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:9389d2f932710695bc46f07db551f7af2feb21c9654e989da89f8b49108f8850",
