      "name": "InitializeUITextRendering",
      "signature": "void InitializeUITextRendering(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Initializes and renders text within a UI control element.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load global UI control pointer from DAT_6fa65e50 into ECX register\n2. Load text resource address 0x6fa5e256 into EDX register\n3. Tail call to RenderTextInUIControl with ECX and EDX as implicit parameters\n\nParameters:\nNone (uses implicit ECX and EDX registers for __stdcall convention)\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value, text rendering is performed via side effects\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- This is a wrapper/initialization function that sets up parameters and delegates to RenderTextInUIControl\n- ECX contains the active UI control instance pointer\n- EDX contains the base address for text resource data",
      "name_source": "LoD/PD2",
      "method": "NOP",
