      "name": "GetLocaleInfoWideToBuffer",
      "signature": "int GetLocaleInfoWideToBuffer(LCID param_1, LCTYPE param_2, LPWSTR param_3, int param_4, UINT param_5)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Retrieves locale information and converts it to a wide-character buffer.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize API mode flag on first call by testing GetLocaleInfoW availability\n2. If mode is 1 (Unicode): Call GetLocaleInfoW directly with parameters\n3. If mode is 2 (ANSI-only): \n   a. Get required buffer size via GetLocaleInfoA with NULL buffer\n   b. Allocate stack space aligned to 4-byte boundary for ANSI buffer\n   c. Retrieve locale info into ANSI buffer\n   d. Convert ANSI string to wide string via MultiByteToWideChar\n4. Return number of characters written, or 0 on failure\n\nParameters:\n- lcid (LCID): Locale identifier for the locale info query\n- lcType (LCTYPE): Type of locale information to retrieve (e.g., LOCALE_SLANGUAGE)\n- pwszBuffer (LPWSTR): Output buffer for wide-character locale string, or NULL for size query\n- nBufferSize (int): Size of pwszBuffer in characters, or 0 for size query\n- dwCodePage (UINT): Code page for ANSI-to-Unicode conversion (0 uses system default from g_dwDefaultCodePage)\n\nReturns:\n- Success: Number of characters written to pwszBuffer (including null terminator)\n- Failure: 0 if locale API calls fail or system doesn't support locale info\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- First call initializes g_dwApiSupportMode at 0x0041381c (1=Unicode, 2=ANSI-only)\n- If dwCodePage is 0, uses default code page from global g_dwDefaultCodePage (0x004136cc)\n- NULL pwszBuffer with nBufferSize=0 returns required buffer size\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x0041381c: g_dwApiSupportMode - API support detection cache\n- 0x004136cc: g_dwDefaultCodePage - Default code page for conversion\n- 0x1: Mode for Unicode API support (GetLocaleInfoW available)\n- 0x2: Mode for ANSI-only API support (must use GetLocaleInfoA + conversion)",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
