      "name": "ProcessSelectedUnit",
      "signature": "int ProcessSelectedUnit(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Processes the currently selected unit from the unit list and initiates game login.\n\nIterates through the linked list of units starting at g_pUnitListHead until finding\nthe unit at index g_dwPlayerSelectCount. Extracts unit name from offset +0x80,\nconverts from Unicode to ANSI, validates the unit via InitializeBnetLoginScreenObjects,\nand initiates login through the Battle.net client interface.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize unit index counter to 0 and get unit list head pointer\n2. Loop through linked list following +0x1c8 offset links\n3. When unit index matches g_dwPlayerSelectCount:\n   a. Validate unit pointer is non-null (return 0 if null)\n   b. Set g_dwExpansionUIState to 1 (activating UI state)\n   c. Extract unit name from unit struct at offset +0x80\n   d. If name null or empty, use default name buffer from g_adwPad_6fa97634\n   e. Convert Unicode name to ANSI via unicode2Win (max 127 chars)\n   f. Validate unit via InitializeBnetLoginScreenObjects\n   g. If validation fails (returns 0):\n      - Show error dialog via ShowSimpleMessageDialog with string ID 0x145B\n      - Reset UI state and return 1\n   h. Format connection string via SafeStringFormat\n   i. Call BNet client interface at offset +0x70\n   j. Reset g_dwStateChangeFlag, increment g_dwUICounter\n4. Call ProcessAndDeleteFiles with unit data and name buffer\n5. Call InitializeGameState to finalize\n6. Reset g_dwExpansionUIState to 0 and return 1\n7. If no matching unit found, return 0\n\nParameters:\n  None - Function reads g_dwPlayerSelectCount global for selection index\n\nReturns:\n  1 - Unit processed successfully or error dialog shown\n  0 - No matching unit found or unit pointer was null\n\nGlobals Accessed (Read):\n  g_pUnitListHead - Head of unit linked list\n  g_dwPlayerSelectCount - Index of currently selected unit\n  g_pBnclientInterface - Battle.net client interface pointer\n  g_adwPad_6fa97634 - Default name buffer fallback\n\nGlobals Modified (Write):\n  g_dwExpansionUIState - Set to 1 during processing, reset to 0 on exit\n  g_dwStateChangeFlag - Reset to 0 on successful validation\n  g_dwUICounter - Incremented by 1 on successful validation\n\nStructure Layout (Unit struct accessed):\n  Offset  Size  Field            Description\n  +0x80   var   pszUnitName      Unicode unit name string\n  +0x1c8  4     pNextUnit        Pointer to next unit in linked list\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x145B - String ID for validation error message\n  0x7F   - Maximum character count for unicode2Win conversion (127)\n  0x70   - Offset into g_pBnclientInterface for login call",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:c19d4eeb9513327ff9d140e1a650c44e56971edeb445a63bfe4160a5436b306e",
