      "name": "HandleBnetConnectionError",
      "signature": "undefined4 HandleBnetConnectionError(ushort wszTitleBuffer)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Displays error dialogs for Battle.net connection failures based on error code.\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Allocate stack buffers for Unicode strings (3x 0x200 wchars = 0x1004 bytes)\n  2. Initialize Unicode string buffers via default constructors\n  3. Switch on error code (*pErrorInfo at offset 0) to select dialog strings:\n     - Cases 1,3: Two-button dialog (OK/Cancel style)\n     - Cases 2,4,5,7: One-button info dialog  \n     - Case 6: Custom error with parameter string from pErrorInfo+4\n     - Cases 8,default: Generic connection error\n     - Cases 9-11 (0x9-0xB): CD Key errors with reconnect callback\n     - Cases 12-14 (0xC-0xE): Account/version errors\n     - Cases 15-22 (0xF-0x16): Realm/character errors with realm callback\n  4. Load localized strings via ValidateStringId():\n     - Title string ID stored in ESI (0x147C-0x1481)\n     - Message string ID stored in ECX (0x143F-0x14EC)\n     - Optional button string in [ESP+0x10]\n  5. Display dialog based on button count (EDI):\n     - 0: FUN_6fa77300 - single message dialog\n     - 1: FUN_6fa76730 - title + message dialog\n     - 2: FUN_6fa76980 - title + message + button dialog\n  6. If bDisconnect (EBP), call Bnclient->Disconnect (vtable 0x10)\n  7. Return 0 (FALSE - connection failed)\n\nParameters:\n  pErrorInfo (ECX)  Pointer to BnetErrorInfo structure:\n                    +0x00: dwErrorCode - Error type (1-22, see switch cases)\n                    +0x04: pszErrorParam - Optional error string (case 6 only)\n\nReturns:\n  BOOL - Always returns FALSE (0) indicating connection failure\n\nError Code Reference:\n  Code | Title ID | Message ID | Description\n  1    | 0x147D   | 0x1443     | Connection timeout (2-button)\n  2    | 0x147E   | 0x143F     | Unable to connect\n  3    | 0x147F   | 0x1442     | Disconnected (2-button)\n  4    | 0x147F   | 0x144F     | Server busy\n  5    | 0x147F   | 0x1452     | Game version outdated\n  6    | 0x147F   | 0x1450/51  | Custom error with param string\n  7    | 0x147F   | 0x14EC     | Battle.net unavailable\n  8    | 0x147F   | 0x1445     | Generic error (2-button)\n  9    | 0x147C   | 0x1458     | CD Key in use (reconnect)\n  10   | 0x147C   | 0x1457     | Invalid CD Key (reconnect)\n  11   | 0x147C   | 0x1459     | CD Key banned (reconnect)\n  12   | 0x1480   | 0x14E5     | Account closed\n  13   | 0x1480   | 0x14EA     | Version check failed\n  14   | 0x1480   | 0x14E3     | Account locked\n  15   | 0x1481   | 0x146F     | Realm unavailable\n  16   | 0x1481   | 0x1470     | Realm busy\n  17   | 0x1481   | 0x1471     | Character timeout\n  18   | 0x1481   | 0x1477     | Character locked\n  19   | 0x1481   | 0x1472     | Character not found\n  20   | 0x1481   | 0x1473     | Character deleted\n  21   | 0x1481   | 0x1474     | Character expired\n  22   | 0x1481   | 0x1475     | Character conversion",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
