      "name": "InitializeNetworkInterfaceUI",
      "signature": "dword InitializeNetworkInterfaceUI(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "InitializeNetworkInterfaceUI - Initializes the Battle.net gateway selection dialog UI\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call InitializeGameUI() to set up base UI subsystem\n2. Create 6 UI controls from factory specs with boundary validation:\n   a. Title text control (spec offset 0x39b)\n   b. Info textbox with string 0x2a64 (gateway label)\n   c. Description textbox with string 0x2a65 (region label)\n   d. Gateway listbox stored at g_apControlObjects[0x4f]\n   e. OK button control\n   f. Cancel button control\n3. Query BNClient interface via vtable[0xa4] for gateway info structure\n4. Enumerate gateways starting at index 1 (skip index 0):\n   - Get gateway name via BNGatewayAccess::Name\n   - Convert ANSI to Unicode via ConvertStringToUnicode\n   - Add to gateway listbox\n5. Calculate auto-scroll position based on pre-selected gateway:\n   - Get visible line count from textbox field 58\n   - Compare selected index against visible region\n   - Call ScrollbarNavigateToIndex if content exceeds bounds\n6. Set final selection value and initialize button text labels\n7. Return 1 for success\n\nParameters: None (void)\n\nReturns:\n- dword: 1 on successful initialization\n\nCalling Convention: __stdcall (callee cleans stack, RET 4)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Fatal error via ReportError(-1) if UI object count exceeds 64 (0x3f max)\n- Gateway enumeration starts at index 1, skipping index 0\n- Auto-scroll triggers when selected gateway is outside visible region\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x3f (63): Maximum UI object count before overflow\n- 0x2a64: Localized string ID for gateway label\n- 0x2a65: Localized string ID for region label  \n- 0x4f (79): Index in g_apControlObjects for gateway listbox\n- 0xa4: BNClient vtable offset for GetGatewayInfo function\n- 0x8: Offset in gateway info for gateway count\n- 0xc: Offset in gateway info for selected index\n\nStructure Layout (BNGatewayInfo at nBNClientInfo):\nOffset  Size  Field               Description\n0x00    0x8   (unknown)           Reserved/header bytes\n0x08    0x4   dwGatewayCount      Total number of gateways available\n0x0c    0x4   dwSelectedIndex     Currently selected gateway index",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
