      "name": "ProcessCleanupAndReinitialize",
      "signature": "undefined4 ProcessCleanupAndReinitialize(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Cleanup and reinitialize game state for new game/reset.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Dispatch handlers for UI objects (dispatch inventory handlers for all g_dwUIObjectCount objects)\n2. Clear UI object array and reset UI counts\n3. Dispatch handlers for game objects (dispatch pending control handlers for all g_dwGameObjectCount objects)\n4. Clear game object array and reset game object count\n5. Clear global configuration (SetGlobalConfig(0))\n6. If palette reinit flag set: compare palette data, format paths, update palette, initialize act palette\n7. Release all game units from memory\n8. Clear hash table and cleanup structures\n9. Store value to persistent state (SetStoredValue(1))\n10. Retrieve music options from configuration\n11. If music enabled: initialize music track state\n12. Initialize game menus\n13. Return success status\n\nParameters: None\n\nReturns: int - 1 on success\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Palette reinitialization requires comparing old/new palette data and reformatting paths\n- Uses stack buffers for palette path construction (260 bytes each)\n- Loop increments pointer arithmetic rather than array indexing\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x5a - offset in g_aPendingControlHandlers for palette comparison result\n- 260 - buffer size for palette paths (aCStack_104, aCStack_208)\n\nError Handling:\n- No explicit error checking; all operations assumed to succeed\n- Returns 1 unconditionally if music initialization succeeds\n\nCalled Functions:\n- DispatchInventoryItemHandler() - processes inventory/UI objects\n- SetGlobalConfig(int) - resets configuration to default\n- InitActPalette() - reinitializes palette data\n- ReleaseAllUnits() - deallocates all game units\n- ClearHashTableAndCleanup() - clears internal hash tables\n- SetStoredValue(int) - persists value\n- GetMusicOptions() - retrieves music configuration\n- InitializeMusicTrackState(int) - initializes music playback\n- InitializeGameMenus() - initializes UI menus\n- wsprintfA() - formats palette file paths\n\nGlobal Variables Used:\n- g_dwUIObjectCount - count of UI objects to process\n- g_pUIObjectArray - array of UI object pointers\n- g_dwGameObjectCount - count of game objects to process\n- g_aPendingControlHandlers - pending control handler array\n- _g_dw_Unknown1, _g_dw_Unknown2 - cleared during reset\n- g_bPaletteReinitFlag - indicates palette needs reinitialization\n- PTR_s_palette_fechar_pal_pal_pl2_6fa8d444 - palette data pointer\n- PTR_s_palette_fechar_pal_dat_6fa8d440 - palette data pointer",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.04b",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:06547c3ec4fa5a674cce075cafc634e12fe109e3e92e0085dc07fb6dd1cc645b",
