      "name": "ProcessCharacterSelectionLogin",
      "signature": "uint ProcessCharacterSelectionLogin(int nUIMode)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Processes character selection and initiates login sequence for single player or Battle.net.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate UI mode parameter - return early if mode is 0\n2. Retrieve password and account name from UI edit boxes\n3. Copy credentials to global config structure at offsets 0x88 (user) and 0xa0 (password)\n4. Attempt Battle.net login via PerformBnetLogin()\n5. If login fails, return with failure indication\n6. Save username to Windows registry for persistence\n7. Check game mode flag at g_dwGameMode:\n   - If single player (== 1): initialize local game state\n   - If multiplayer: search for save files in save directory\n8. For each inventory slot up to g_dwSlotCount1 and g_dwSlotCount2:\n   - Dispatch inventory item handlers to process slot data\n9. Reset global configuration via SetGlobalConfig(0)\n10. If palette flag is set, compare and initialize act palettes:\n    - Build palette paths using wsprintfA\n    - Compare palette strings byte-by-byte\n    - Call InitActPalette with path buffers\n11. Clean up hash table and release allocated units\n12. Store login state (1 = logged in) via SetStoredValue\n\nParameters:\n  nUIMode (int) - UI mode indicator. 0 = no selection active, non-zero = process login\n\nReturns:\n  uint - Always returns 1 (TRUE) on successful completion\n  uint - Returns 0 (FALSE) if PerformBnetLogin fails or invalid state\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - nUIMode == 0: Early return with value 1 after calling InitializeGameMenus\n  - No save files found: Calls InitializeGameMenus and returns 1\n  - Battle.net login failure: Returns 0 immediately\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x88 - Offset to username field in config structure\n  0xa0 - Offset to password field in config structure\n  0x100 (256) - Maximum buffer size for credential strings\n  0x400 (1024) - Path buffer size for palette/save paths\n\nGlobals Modified:\n  g_dwActiveSlot, g_dwSlotCount1, g_dwSlotCount2, g_dwPaletteFlag, g_dwGameMode",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "NOP",
