      "name": "InitializeBnclientInterface",
      "signature": "undefined4 InitializeBnclientInterface(int param_1)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Initializes the Battle.net client interface by loading Bnclient.dll.\\n\\n  Algorithm:\\n    1. Validate pParams is not NULL (assert if NULL)\\n    2. Check if interface already initialized at offset 0x21d (541)\\n    3. If not initialized:\\n       a. Load \\\"Bnclient.dll\\\" via LoadLibraryA\\n       b. Get \\\"QueryInterface\\\" export via GetProcAddress\\n       c. Call QueryInterface to obtain interface pointer\\n       d. Store interface pointer in global and pParams+0x21d\\n       e. Call first vtable method to complete initialization\\n\\n  Parameters:\\n    pParams (ECX) - Pointer to D2Multi params structure; offset 0x21d stores\\n                    the Bnclient interface pointer after initialization\\n\\n  Returns:\\n    TRUE (1)  - Interface initialized successfully or already initialized\\n    FALSE (0) - Failed to load Bnclient.dll or QueryInterface export not found\\n\\n  Special Cases:\\n    - Displays MessageBox with \\\"D2Multi\\\" title on failure (MB_ICONHAND = 0x10)\\n    - Calls FogAssert if pParams is NULL (line 0x47 = 71)\\n    - Caches module handle in g_hBnclientModule (0x6fa96c60)\\n    - Caches interface pointer in g_pBnclientInterface (0x6fa96c64)",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.09d",
