      "name": "InitializeGameState",
      "signature": "void InitializeGameState(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Initializes game state and UI after validating expansion files.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if expansion MPQ files exist; if missing, show initialization screen and exit\n2. Call cleanup/reinitialize to reset previous game state\n3. Set global game configuration from pending control handlers\n4. Load sky palette for environment rendering\n5. Check game mode: 1=Expansion(LoD), 0=Classic, 2=TCP/IP, 3=Open Bnet\n6. Initialize UI elements: allocate timer, player count, mercenary, message lists\n7. Create player slot UI elements (4 slots for LoD, 5 for Classic)\n8. Load preferred realm from registry (HKCU\\Software\\Blizzard Entertainment\\Diablo II)\n9. Release existing composite units and clear unit linked list\n10. For expansion: hash realm name and look up cached character in hash table\n11. For classic/single: enumerate .d2s save files and load valid characters\n12. Update UI display and initialize music based on options\n13. Mark UI as ready for display\n\nParameters: None (void function)\n\nReturns: void\n\nSide Effects:\n- Modifies global UI state (g_pUIElementArray, g_dwPlayerCount, etc.)\n- Initializes player character data structures\n- Clears and reloads game unit lists\n- Loads save game files from disk\n- Updates registry with realm preference\n- Initializes music/audio subsystem\n\nError Handling:\n- If CheckExpansionMpqExists fails: shows initialization screen via InitializeGameplayScreen\n- If Bnet unavailable: shows error dialog with string ID 0x14e3 or 0x14aa\n- Invalid save files skipped: validates name length (2-16 chars), no leading underscore/trailing dash\n\nStack Layout:\nOffset    Size    Variable           Description\n-0xa40    0x140   _WIN32_FIND_DATAA  File search data structure\n-0x900    0x100   auStack_900        Character data buffer (assembly-only)\n-0x800    0x400   szSaveDirectory    Save directory path (1024 chars)\n-0x400    0x400   szSearchPattern    Search pattern \"*.d2s\" (1024 chars)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x79  - Timer UI object type ID\n0x7b  - ShowPlayersUI type ID\n0x7c  - HasJoinedGameUI type ID\n0x7d  - PlayerCountUI type ID\n0x97  - ExpansionUI2 type ID (LoD only)\n0x78  - ExpansionUI3 type ID (LoD only)\n0x95  - UIStateFlags type ID\n0x96  - ExpansionUIFlags type ID\n0xf6  - Base offset for LoD player slots (increments by 0x5d)\n0x99  - Base offset for Classic player slots\n0x14aa - \"No characters found\" string ID\n0x14e3 - \"Connection unavailable\" string ID\n0x1419 - \"Create new character\" prompt string ID",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
