      "name": "InitializeControlsPanel",
      "signature": "undefined InitializeControlsPanel(Unicode * param_1, undefined4 param_2)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Initialize controls panel with optional text content.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Flush pending control handler queue by dispatching all queued items\n2. Clear pending handler count and determine control configuration type\n3. Create and register three UI control objects based on configuration:\n   - Primary control object (type depends on g_apControlObjects[0x5a])\n   - Sub-control object from configuration table\n   - Text box control for display\n4. Initialize all three control objects by setting flags\n5. Copy input text to local buffer (Unicode, 1024 wide chars)\n6. Parse text buffer and split on newline characters (L'\n')\n7. Add each text line to text box control without formatting\n\nParameters:\n  ECX: pszText - Unicode text string to display (null-terminated)\n  EDX: dwControlConfig - Configuration selector (affects control type selection)\n\nReturns:\n  void (no return value)\n\nError Handling:\n  - Validates pending handler count <= 0x3f (63), fatal error if exceeded\n  - Calls FogAssert for bounds checking failures\n  - Exits with ReportError(-1) on overflow\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - If g_apControlObjects[0x5a] == 0: uses g_adwLocalControlConfig and g_adwLocalTextBoxConfig\n  - If g_apControlObjects[0x5a] != 0: uses g_adwBnetControlConfig and g_adwBnetTextBoxConfig\n  - Config offset calculation: (negate(dwControlConfig != 0) & mask) + offset, mask varies per path\n  - Stride calculation: offset*3 << 4 = offset*48 (control config entry size)\n\nText Processing:\n  - Splits input on L'\n' newline character\n  - Replaces newlines with null terminators\n  - Adds remaining text after final newline if present\n  - All text adds use TextBoxAddText with flags 0,0\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x804: Stack buffer size (2048 bytes = 1024 wide chars)\n  0x3f: Maximum pending handlers (63)\n  0x5a: Array index for configuration check (90 dwords)\n  0x30: Control configuration entry size (48 bytes)\n  0x400: Text buffer element count (1024 wide chars)\n\nGlobals Used:\n  g_nControlObjectCount: Current pending handler count\n  g_apControlObjects: Pending control object array (64 capacity)\n  g_adwLocalControlConfig: Primary control config for local/offline mode\n  g_adwLocalTextBoxConfig: Text box control config for local mode\n  g_adwBnetControlConfig: Primary control config for Battle.net mode\n  g_adwBnetTextBoxConfig: Text box control config for Battle.net mode",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.09d",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:0c17465310fc8e1266843ca0c6ddd3de706ab6dc96a7f3a61a3d6bdb0da906a5",
