      "name": "DispatchLoginHandlerState",
      "signature": "undefined DispatchLoginHandlerState(char param_1)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "DispatchLoginHandlerState - Initialize login handler state based on account information flag\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load global control handler structure from g_aPendingControlHandlers[0x53]\n2. Clear all handler state flags at offsets 0x80-0x86 to 0x00\n3. Store input parameter bHandlerState at handler offset 0x1e9\n4. Switch on bHandlerState value:\n   - 0x00: Set flag at offset 0x80 = 1 (single-player or default mode)\n   - 0x01: Set flag at offset 0x82 = 1 (alternate mode flag 1)\n   - 0x02: Set flag at offset 0x83 = 1 (alternate mode flag 2)\n   - 0x03: Set flag at offset 0x81 = 1 (online mode indicator)\n   - 0x04: Set flag at offset 0x84 = 1 (battle.net mode indicator)\n   - 0x05: Set flag at offset 0x85 = 1 (ladder mode flag)\n   - 0x06: Set flag at offset 0x86 = 1 (special mode flag)\n   - Other: No additional flags set (all cleared)\n5. Return void (no return value)\n\nParameters:\n  bHandlerState (CL): Handler mode indicator byte (0x00-0x06 for routing, other values clear flags)\n\nReturns:\n  void (no return value)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Handler state is called from ProcessBattleNetLogin with bAccountInfo parameter\n  - All flag fields are unconditionally cleared before routing\n  - The function acts as a state machine dispatcher\n  - Offset 0x1e9 stores the state value for later reference\n\nHandler State Routing:\n  0x00 \u2192 Single-player/default (flag offset 0x80)\n  0x01 \u2192 Account mode 1 (flag offset 0x82)\n  0x02 \u2192 Account mode 2 (flag offset 0x83)\n  0x03 \u2192 Online mode (flag offset 0x81)\n  0x04 \u2192 BattleNet mode (flag offset 0x84)\n  0x05 \u2192 Ladder mode (flag offset 0x85)\n  0x06 \u2192 Special mode (flag offset 0x86)\n\nGlobal Handler Structure (g_aPendingControlHandlers[0x53]):\n  Offset    Size   Field Name              Type        Description\n  0x80      1      fDefaultMode            byte        Default/single-player mode flag\n  0x81      1      fOnlineMode             byte        Online mode indicator\n  0x82      1      fAccountMode1           byte        Account routing flag 1\n  0x83      1      fAccountMode2           byte        Account routing flag 2\n  0x84      1      fBattleNetMode          byte        BattleNet connection mode flag\n  0x85      1      fLadderMode             byte        Ladder/seasonal mode flag\n  0x86      1      fSpecialMode            byte        Special feature/flag mode\n  0x1e9     1      bHandlerState           byte        Current handler state routing value",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.09d",
