      "comment": "Creates and initializes a player game unit structure from character data.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Allocates 923 bytes for the game unit structure using FogMemAlloc\n2. Copies character name to unit structure using SStrCopy\n3. Converts realm name to Unicode if provided, otherwise clears realm field\n4. Decodes character class from variable-length encoded data\n5. Initializes realm string tables if first invocation (one-time setup)\n6. Searches realm list for matching realm name, formats display path if found\n7. Parses character data fields: components, class, level, exp, emblem info\n8. Creates composite unit via CreateCompositeUnit, retries with fallback type on failure\n9. Asserts non-null composite unit, exits fatally if allocation fails\n10. Configures emblem icon, data fields, and scaled values on created unit\n11. Inserts unit into global linked list sorted by account ID / game ID\n12. Updates expansion display and sets connection retry flag if needed\n\nParameters:\nszCharacterName (ECX) - Character name string to copy into unit\nszRealmName (EDX) - Realm name for unit, NULL to clear realm field\nnCharacterData - Pointer to encoded character data buffer\ndwGameId - Game session ID for list sorting\ndwAccountId - Account ID for list sorting and lookup\n\nReturns:\n1 on success with unit created and linked into global list\n0 on error (realm mismatch triggers error report and early exit)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x39b (923) - Size of game unit structure allocation\n0x7fffffff - Max copy length for SStrCopy\n0x80 (128) - Realm name Unicode buffer size\n0xff - Invalid emblem marker value (cleared to 0)\n0x43a (1082) - Assertion line number for null unit check\n\nStructure Layout (GameUnit at EBP):\nOffset   Size   Field                Description\n0x80     128    wszRealmName         Unicode realm name (WCHAR[64])\n0x180    16     abComponents         Component data array\n0x190    16     abComponentIndices   Component index array\n0x1a0    1      byCharClass          Character class (-1 adjusted)\n0x1a2    2      wClassFlags          Character class flags\n0x1a4    2      wCharLevel           Character level\n0x1a6    2      wCharClass2          Secondary class identifier\n0x1a8    2      wCharExperience      Experience points\n0x1aa    3      abSkillData          Skill data bytes\n0x1ae    1      byEmblemType         Emblem type (0xff -> 0)\n0x1af    1      byEmblemColor        Emblem color index\n0x1b0    1      byEmblemMode         Emblem display mode\n0x1b4    4      dwUnitFlags          Unit state flags\n0x1b8    4      pCompositeUnit       Pointer to composite unit\n0x1c0    4      dwGameId             Game session identifier\n0x1c4    4      dwAccountId          Account identifier\n0x1c8    4      pNextUnit            Next unit in linked list\n\nGlobals:\ng_fRealmTablesInit (6fa975f4) - One-shot realm table initialization flag\ng_pUnitListHead (6fa97604) - Head of global unit linked list\ng_dwUnitCount (6fa9760c) - Count of units in list\ng_fBnetRetry (6fa975f0) - Battle.net connection retry flag",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
