      "name": "GetSelectedUnitAndDispatchHandler",
      "signature": "int GetSelectedUnitAndDispatchHandler(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "GetSelectedUnitAndDispatchHandler - Retrieves selected unit and dispatches handler\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate that player selection count is set (not -1)\n2. Initialize traversal at head of global unit list\n3. Iterate through linked list by following next node pointer at offset +0x1c8\n4. Count iterations until reaching selected unit index\n5. If selected unit found: set game data flag, dispatch pending handlers, convert Unicode name, call handler\n6. Return success status (1)\n\nParameters:\n  void - No parameters\n\nReturns:\n  int: 1 on success, 1 if selection count invalid or linked list traversal fails\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Returns 1 if g_dwPlayerSelectCount == -1 (no selection)\n  - Returns 1 if selected index exceeds linked list size\n  - Terminates early if null pointer encountered during traversal\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x1c8: Offset to next unit pointer in unit linked list structure\n  0x20b: Offset to flag in g_pBnetGameData structure\n  0x80: Offset to unit name field (Unicode)\n  0x1a4: Offset to unit property (passed as parameter)\n  0x1a0: Offset to unit property (passed as parameter)\n  0x7f: Maximum unicode string length (127 chars)\n\nError Handling:\n  If linked list traversal encounters null before reaching selected index,\n  returns 1 to indicate failure\n\nDependencies:\n  - g_dwPlayerSelectCount: Selected unit index (-1 if none)\n  - g_pUnitListHead: Head of global unit linked list\n  - g_pBnetGameData: Global battle.net game state\n  - DispatchPendingControlHandlers(): Processes queued input handlers\n  - Unicode::unicode2Win(): Converts Unicode string to Windows format\n  - FUN_6fa80ae0(): Handler function for selected unit",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
