      "name": "InitializeExpansionUIControls",
      "signature": "int InitializeExpansionUIControls(void)",
      "calling_convention": "unknown",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Initialize expansion UI controls if expansion MPQ exists.\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Call CheckExpansionMpqExists to verify expansion file availability\n  2. If expansion exists, dispatch pending control event handlers\n  3. Get control references for expansion inventory slots (0xD3-0xD6)\n  4. Set unit flags on all expansion inventory controls\n  5. Retrieve and format localized text strings (IDs 0x58CE, 0x58CF, 0x58D0)\n  6. Add formatted text to expansion text box\n  7. Return success (always returns 1)\n\nParameters:\n  None\n\nReturns:\n  Always returns 1 (success)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0xD3, 0xD4, 0xD5, 0xD6: Expansion inventory control indices\n  0x58CE, 0x58CF, 0x58D0: String resource IDs for expansion info\n  1: Success/enabled flag value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - If expansion MPQ does not exist, function returns immediately without initializing UI\n  - All text additions use zero index and flag values for formatting",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:7aa7f28d6a7addbfd7ae5acdf16cf29de69e734bb118158a5ed9a1b88feb6b25",
