      "name": "DispatchControlHandlersAndSetText",
      "signature": "uint DispatchControlHandlersAndSetText(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "uint",
      "comment": "Dispatches pending control handlers and initializes UI text elements.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call DispatchPendingControlHandlers() to process pending events\n2. Loop through control indices 0xcf, 0xd0, 0xd1, 0xd2 retrieving each control item\n3. For each retrieved control, call SetUnitFlags(control, 1) to set flag value\n4. Call ValidateStringId(0x142b) to validate string resource before use\n5. Call TextBoxAddText() to add the validated text with context 0 and newline 0\n6. Return success code 1\n\nParameters:\n(none - no parameters passed)\n\nReturns:\nuint - Always returns 1 indicating successful execution\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0xcf, 0xd0, 0xd1, 0xd2 - Inventory-related control item indices\n0x142b - String resource ID for text content\n1 - Flag value and success return code",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
