      "name": "CheckAndToggleExpansionFlag",
      "signature": "int CheckAndToggleExpansionFlag(void)",
      "calling_convention": "unknown",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Check expansion MPQ file existence and toggle control handler flag.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call CheckExpansionMpqExists to verify expansion is available\n2. If expansion check fails (returns 0), return failure code\n3. Toggle the 0x20 flag (bit 5) in the control handler at offset 0x1ea\n4. Return success code (1)\n\nParameters:\n  (none)\n\nReturns:\n  0 if expansion MPQ does not exist\n  1 if expansion was found and flag was toggled successfully\n\nStructure Layout:\n  Offset | Size | Field Name | Type | Description\n  0x53   | 4    | handler    | ptr  | Control handler pointer from g_aPendingControlHandlers[0x53]\n  0x1ea  | 2    | flags      | uint | Bitfield containing expansion status flag at bit 5 (0x20)\n\nFlag Bits:\n  0x20 - Expansion enabled flag (toggled by XOR operation)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "NOP",
