      "name": "ProcessGameObjectHandlers",
      "signature": "uint ProcessGameObjectHandlers(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "uint",
      "comment": "Initialize and dispatch game object handlers, manage pending control handlers, and run main message pump.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Iterate through pending handlers and dispatch them to inventory handler\n2. Reset handler count to 0\n3. Create and initialize three game objects via type factory:\n   - ConfigTypeA object with inventory settings\n   - ConfigTypeB object (DAT_6fa901c0)\n   - TextBox object (DAT_6fa91e10)\n4. Add string entries to text box (IDs 0x1430, 0x1431)\n5. Initialize message pump callback system with g_pMessageCallback\n6. Run main message loop until completion\n7. Clean up handlers by dispatching all remaining handlers\n8. Return exit code from g_dwReturnCode\n\nParameters:\nNone (void)\n\nReturns:\nuint - Game exit code from g_dwReturnCode (0 for success, non-zero for error)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
