      "name": "InitializeGameSystem",
      "signature": "int InitializeGameSystem(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Initializes the core game system for a new session.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Loads the global game object pointer from DAT_6fa656c4\n2. Invokes virtual method at offset 0x70 in the object's vtable\n3. Sets initialization flag DAT_6fa65294 to 1 to indicate completion\n4. Calls FUN_6fa57df0 for secondary initialization steps\n5. Returns success status (1)\n\nReturns:\n  int - Always returns 1 to indicate successful initialization\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Vtable offset 0x70 is invoked on global game object\n  - DAT_6fa65294 serves as initialization completion flag\n  - No error handling; assumes successful operations",
