      "name": "ValidateEntityStateAndUpdate",
      "signature": "int ValidateEntityStateAndUpdate(int * pEntity)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Validates an entity and updates its state flags based on unit ID validity.\\n\\nAlgorithm:\\n1. Extract entity pointer from stack parameter (stdcall convention)\\n2. Load unit ID field from entity at offset +0xc (dwUnitId)\\n3. Test if unit ID is non-zero\\n4. If unit ID valid (non-zero): set state flag EDX=1\\n5. If unit ID invalid (zero): set state flag EDX=0\\n6. Call ModifyEntityStateBitFlags with state flag\\n7. Return success code 1\\n\\nParameters:\\n- pEntity: Pointer to entity structure (UnitAny or compatible)\\n  At offset +0xc: dwUnitId (unit identifier field)\\n  Valid if non-zero, invalid if zero\\n\\nReturns:\\n- Always returns 1 (success)\\n\\nSpecial Cases:\\n- The global value at 0x6fa65acc is loaded but not directly used in the state determination\\n- Function always returns 1 regardless of entity validity\\n- State flag passed to ModifyEntityStateBitFlags: 1 for valid unit, 0 for invalid\\n\\nStructure Layout:\\nOffset | Size | Field Name | Type | Description\\n-------|------|------------|------|-------------\\n+0xc   | 4    | dwUnitId   | DWORD| Unique unit identifier (0=invalid, >0=valid)",
      "name_source": "LoD/PD2",
