      "name": "InitializeGameUI",
      "signature": "int InitializeGameUI(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Initializes game UI and command processing system.\\n\\nAlgorithm:\\n1. Validates and retrieves object field data from global context\\n2. Converts Unicode string to Windows format for UI rendering\\n3. Initializes game command queue and processes pending commands\\n4. Returns success status (1)\\n\\nParameters:\\nNone\\n\\nReturns:\\nint - Returns 1 to indicate successful initialization\\n\\nSpecial Cases:\\n- DAT_6fa65abc is a global pointer to UI data buffer\\n- Offset 0x89 within the buffer is where Unicode text is written\\n- Buffer size is 0x100 (256 bytes) for Unicode string\\n- FUN_6fa50820 performs critical game command initialization with bounds checking\\n\\nStructure Layout:\\nThe UI data structure at DAT_6fa65abc contains:\\nOffset | Size | Field Name | Type | Description\\n0x89   | 0x100| uiText     | char[256] | Buffer for UI Unicode text",
