      "name": "UpdateRenderingState",
      "signature": "int UpdateRenderingState(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Conditionally updates rendering state based on game status and rendering flags.\nChecks if the game status is 0x65 (likely 'e' for an error or escape state) and whether \nrendering is enabled. If status != 0x65 and rendering is disabled, processes and renders \nscaled frame text. Otherwise initializes the rendering state.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Retrieve current game status from the status callback at offset 0x4c of global state\n2. Compare status value against sentinel 0x65\n3. If status equals 0x65, skip to rendering initialization\n4. If status != 0x65, check if rendering is disabled (DAT_6fa65294 == 0)\n5. If rendering disabled, call ProcessAndRenderScaledFrameText to render text\n6. Otherwise call InitializeRenderingState to initialize rendering\n7. Return success code (1)\n\nReturns:\n1 - Always returns 1 indicating successful completion\n\nSpecial Cases:\n0x65 - Sentinel value indicating special game state (possibly escape/menu state)\nDAT_6fa65294 - Global flag controlling rendering enabled/disabled state (0=disabled, non-zero=enabled)",
      "name_source": "LoD/PD2",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:5d2877064d49222caf406213d2695fe3e52d0da6662f07f71e8701de0dcd9eaa",
