      "name": "OpenValidateAndReleaseFile",
      "signature": "int OpenValidateAndReleaseFile(int pFileIdentifier)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Opens, validates, and releases a game file in a single atomic operation.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Store file identifier parameter in local buffer (local_4 = pFileIdentifier)\n2. Call OpenAndValidateGameFile with stored identifier to perform validation\n3. Test validation result for non-zero success value\n4. If validation failed (result == 0), skip release and return 0 immediately\n5. If validation succeeded, call ReleaseFileHandleWithRefCount to clean up\n6. Return 1 to indicate success\n\nParameters:\n- pFileIdentifier (ECX): File identifier or path reference passed in fastcall convention\n\nReturns:\n- 0 if OpenAndValidateGameFile validation fails\n- 1 if validation succeeds and file is released\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- File must be released immediately after validation in success path\n- Validation failure path skips release operation and returns early\n- Local buffer at ESP stores the file identifier for reference across calls",
      "name_source": "LoD/PD2",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:f50da444b16b6ce49a0195d3f555ea6e27555dd50011a05b6df5789dcf31f990",
