      "name": "InitializeGameResourcesAndLoadText",
      "signature": "Unicode * InitializeGameResourcesAndLoadText(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "Unicode *",
      "comment": "Initializes game resources and loads credits text from MPQ files.\\n\\nPerforms the following operations:\\n1. Validates expansion pack availability via FindAndValidateD2ExpMpq\\n2. Selects appropriate credits file path based on validation\\n3. Formats file path using FormatStringBuffer\\n4. Initializes network session and validates connection\\n5. Retrieves default resource count from game configuration\\n6. Allocates memory buffer for raw file data (4914 bytes)\\n7. Initializes buffer to zero using optimized STOSD loop\\n8. Detects Unicode BOM (Byte Order Mark) to identify encoding:\\n   - 0xFEFF: Big-endian Unicode (after stripping BOM)\\n   - 0xFFFE: Little-endian Unicode with byte swap\\n   - Other: Standard ASCII, convert via win2Unicode\\n9. Initializes module with credits ID (0x13b3)\\n10. Processes output buffer to remove line terminators (CR 0xD, LF 0xA)\\n11. Returns pointer to processed Unicode text buffer\\n\\nReturns NULL if network initialization fails. Calls CleanupAndAbort on memory allocation failure.",
