      "name": "InitializeGameInterfaceAndCommands",
      "signature": "void InitializeGameInterfaceAndCommands(uint gameMode)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Initializes the game interface and queues command processing based on game mode.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Calls FUN_6fa55d30 to initialize palette/graphics state\n2. Destroys all existing UI controls (iterates through DAT_6fa653c0 array)\n3. Resets DAT_6fa65e34 (UI control count) to 0\n4. Loads sky palette resource (s_palette_sky_pal_pl2_6fa5e988)\n5. Validates and processes 11 game commands, storing results in buffer DAT_6fa652b8:\n   - Commands at 0x6fa610a0, 0x6fa61a90, 0x6fa61ac0, 0x6fa61af0, 0x6fa61b20\n   - Commands at 0x6fa61b50, 0x6fa61b80, 0x6fa61bb0, 0x6fa61be0, 0x6fa61c10, 0x6fa61c40\n   - Each command increments buffer index DAT_6fa65e30\n6. Validates buffer did not overflow (max 0x40/64 entries)\n7. Creates Unicode string buffer on stack\n8. Dispatches handler and renders UI text\n9. Based on gameMode parameter, calls ModifyObjectBitfield and InitializeScreenshotSlotWithValidation\n   - Modes 0-6 execute screenshot slot initialization\n   - Mode 7 returns early\n10. On buffer overflow or failed command processing, calls CleanupAndAbort and exits\n\nParameters:\ngameMode (uint): Game mode selector (0-7 for different initialization paths; mode 7 early-returns)\n\nReturns:\nvoid. Does not return normally; calls _exit(-1) on buffer overflow or command failure.\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Buffer size limit: 0x40 (64) entries; overflow triggers cleanup and exit\n- Error handling: Validates command buffer capacity before each command\n- Command result storage: Array at 0x6fa652b8 indexed by DAT_6fa65e30\n- UI control destruction: Loops through array at 0x6fa653c0, destroying each control\n- Calling convention: __stdcall (callee cleanup with RET 0x4)\n\nStructure Layout:\nOffset | Size | Field Name          | Type       | Description\n0x00   | 4    | cmdBuffer[0]        | uint       | Game command result buffer (64 slots)\n0xFC   | 4    | cmdBufferIndex      | uint       | Current index in command buffer\n0x100  | 4    | uiControlArray      | uint*      | Array of UI control pointers\n0x104  | 4    | uiControlCount      | uint       | Number of active UI controls",
      "name_source": "LoD/PD2",
