      "name": "InitializeGatewayConfiguration",
      "signature": "int InitializeGatewayConfiguration(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Initializes gateway configuration for the current session.\\n\\nRetrieves the current gateway ID, validates the selected gateway index, and if valid, configures the gateway with realm information.\\n\\nAlgorithm:\\n1. Get current gateway ID from global structure at offset 0x98\\n2. Validate and retrieve selected gateway index via ValidateAndGetStructureField\\n3. If index is valid (not -1), increment the index\\n4. Set current gateway using the gateway ID\\n5. Retrieve realm information for the gateway\\n6. Call configuration function with realm details\\n7. Execute cleanup routines\\n8. Return success status (1)\\n\\nReturns:\\nint - Always returns 1 (success status)",
      "name_source": "LoD/PD2",
      "method": "NOP",
