      "name": "InitializeGameCommandQueue",
      "signature": "int InitializeGameCommandQueue(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Initializes game command queue with D2 configuration and validation.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call initialization function FUN_6fa55d30\n2. Load and process palette (sky_pal.pl2)\n3. Verify command queue index is below limit (0x40)\n4. Process first game command (0x6fa616d0) and store in buffer\n5. Process second game command (0x6fa61700) and store in buffer\n6. Validate D2 expansion pack status via FindAndValidateD2ExpMpq\n7. Branch based on expansion status:\n   - If not found: process commands 0x6fa61730, 0x6fa61760, 0x6fa61790\n   - If found: process commands 0x6fa617f0, 0x6fa61820, 0x6fa61850\n8. Validate buffer bounds (0x40 limit) after each command\n9. Process final command (0x6fa617c0)\n10. Validate and clear screenshot region bounds\n11. Initialize timer callback\n12. Call game state navigation and initialization\n13. Return 1 on success\n\nReturns:\n  1 - Successfully initialized game command queue\n  Does not return on error (calls _exit(-1))\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  Buffer overflow: If command queue index exceeds 0x40 items, abort with error\n  Magic numbers: 0x40 = command queue size limit, 0x624 = return address offset",
      "name_source": "LoD/PD2",
