      "name": "ProcessGameStateTransition",
      "signature": "int ProcessGameStateTransition(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Processes game state transitions and initializes corresponding rendering modes.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load game mode byte from offset 0x1ea\n2. If mode is 5 or 6, set flag bit 0x20 at offset 0x1eb\n3. Branch based on state value (DAT_6fa65ad4):\n   - State 3: Initialize state as 4, setup rendering with 0x804 config\n   - State 0: Initialize state as 1, setup rendering with conditional flags (0x4 or 0x804)\n   - State 2: Initialize state as 3, setup rendering with conditional flags\n   - State 1: Call secondary initialization function FUN_6fa5a320\n4. Call InitializeRenderingState() to apply config changes\n5. Return 1 (success)\n\nParameters:\nNone\n\nReturns:\nint - Always returns 1 (success status)\n\nStructure Layout:\nOffset | Size | Field Name | Type | Description\n0x1ea  | 1    | gameMode   | byte | Current game mode (5/6 trigger special handling)\n0x1eb  | 2    | modeFlags  | word | Mode configuration flags (bit 0x4, 0x20 affect rendering)\n0x15   | 4    | config0    | dword| Config field cleared on state 0\n0xb9   | 12   | renderCfg  | dword[3] | Rendering configuration buffer\n0xd1   | 1    | field_d1   | byte | Cleared on state 3\n0x205  | 4    | renderMode | dword| Primary render mode (4, 0x804, or 0x100804)\n0x229  | 1    | field_229  | byte | Cleared on state 3\n0x35a  | 1    | gameState  | byte | Game state indicator (1, 3, or 4)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Mode 5/6 triggers automatic flag 0x20 set before state processing\n- State 3 is special boot/initialization state\n- Flag 0x4 selects between render mode 0x4 and 0x804\n- Flag 0x20 adds 0x100000 to render mode for special rendering path",
      "name_source": "LoD/PD2",
