      "name": "InitializeGameUIControls",
      "signature": "void InitializeGameUIControls(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Initializes game UI controls for the current game session\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get current tick count and store in DAT_6fa65558\n2. Destroy all previously active UI controls by iterating through array at DAT_6fa653c0\n   - Iterate while iVar2 < DAT_6fa65e34 (control count)\n   - Call DestroyUIControl for each control pointer\n3. Reset UI control tracking: DAT_6fa65e34 = 0, DAT_6fa65e40 = 1\n4. Create first UI control: ProcessGameCommand(&DAT_6fa63980) \u2192 store in controls[0]\n   - Set event target and entity bit flags (flag=1) on created control\n5. Check if UI count < 0x40 (64 controls max), create second control\n   - ProcessGameCommand(&DAT_6fa639b0) \u2192 store in controls[1]\n   - Set event target and entity bit flags on second control\n6. Check if UI count < 0x40, create third control\n   - ProcessGameCommand(&DAT_6fa639e0) \u2192 store in controls[2]\n   - Set event target and entity bit flags on third control\n7. Initialize rendering state\n   - dispatch_command_handler(0,0,0) - Clear command queue\n   - RenderTextBoxUnicodeText(0,0,0) - Initialize text rendering\n8. Check if UI count < 0x40, create fourth control\n   - ProcessGameCommand(&DAT_6fa63a10) \u2192 DAT_6fa65548\n9. Check if UI count < 0x40, create fifth control\n   - ProcessGameCommand(&DAT_6fa63a40) \u2192 DAT_6fa6554c\n10. Initialize state for game session\n    - DAT_6fa65550 = 0xffffffff (sentinel value)\n    - DAT_6fa65554 = 0 (clear flag)\n    - DAT_6fa6552c = SetGameInitializationFlag\n    - UpdateUIControlState() - Finalize UI state\n11. If any check fails at capacity limit (0x40): abort with error message\n\nReturns:\n- void (no return value; aborts process on error)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- UI capacity limit: 0x40 (64) controls maximum enforced at each stage\n- Control array: DAT_6fa653c0 stores pointers to created UI controls\n- Control count: DAT_6fa65e34 tracks number of active controls\n- Failure handling: GetReturnAddress(0x60d) + CleanupAndAbort + _exit(-1)\n- Control array access: (&DAT_6fa653c0)[DAT_6fa65e34] = uVar1 pattern adds to array\n- Rendering initialization must occur after first 3 controls created\n- Session flags: 0xffffffff in DAT_6fa65550 marks game session start\n\nStructure Layout:\nUI Control Array (at DAT_6fa653c0)\nOffset  Size  Field           Type      Description\n0x0     0x4   controls[0]     void*     First UI control pointer\n0x4     0x4   controls[1]     void*     Second UI control pointer\n0x8     0x4   controls[2]     void*     Third UI control pointer\n0xC     0x4   controls[3]     void*     Fourth UI control pointer\n0x10    0x4   controls[4]     void*     Fifth UI control pointer\n...\n0x100           Total size (64 pointers)",
