      "name": "InitializeBattleNetUI",
      "signature": "int InitializeBattleNetUI(int pConfig)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Initializes BattleNet UI controls and validates configuration settings.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate input configuration parameter (pConfig must be non-zero)\n2. If pConfig is null, call FUN_6fa50820 to get default config and return success\n3. Load global pointers for three system modules via GetEntityModeFlags calls\n4. Allocate two 256-byte buffers on stack for string conversion\n5. Load function pointers from module structures (0x68 and 0xbc offsets)\n6. Call function pointers to convert module names to UTF strings in buffers\n7. Load global game state pointer at 0x6fa656c4\n8. Call method at offset 0x68 to get UI controller object\n9. If UI controller is null, jump to error handler\n10. Call method at offset 0xbc to validate UI configuration with buffer data\n11. If validation fails, jump to error handler\n12. Initialize three UI component constants (0x2b60, 0xe7, 0x11a, 0x11f)\n13. Call functions to convert component IDs to local names\n14. Set three global configuration values (0x6fa64418, 0x6fa64414, 0x6fa64420)\n15. Call ModifyEntityBitFlags to apply configuration flags\n16. Return success (1) or failure (0) based on initialization status\n\nParameters:\n  pConfig: Pointer to configuration structure (or 0 for default)\n\nReturns:\n  1 if initialization successful, 0 if initialization failed\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Null pConfig triggers default configuration path (FUN_6fa50820)\n  - Two 256-byte stack buffers for UTF string conversion\n  - Returns immediately on validation failure at multiple checkpoints\n  - Global configuration values are set before final flag modification",
      "name_source": "LoD/PD2",
