      "name": "InitializeGameStateBuffer",
      "signature": "void InitializeGameStateBuffer(char modeType, void * pGameStateData, ushort controlFlags)",
      "calling_convention": "__thiscall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Initialize game state buffer with mode, data, and control flags.\\n\\nAlgorithm:\\n1. Clear 212-byte buffer at 0x6fa65570 (offset 0x80 * 4 + 4 bytes)\\n2. Set magic header (0xaa55aa55) and size field (0x60)\\n3. Copy game state data using CopyMemoryWithAlignment\\n4. Store mode type and initialize flags with control flags OR 0x1\\n5. Set initial time value via __time32\\n6. Check if mode is 0x05 or 0x06 and set flag 0x20 if true\\n7. Encode mode-specific value (0xd) into encoded buffer\\n8. Copy 4 dwords of reference data from 0x6fa64d9c to buffer\\n9. Loop 11 times copying bytes from reference table\\n10. Set next byte to (modeType + 1)\\n11. Initialize 8 dwords with 0xffffffff sentinel values\\n12. Initialize 9 bytes with 0xff sentinel values\\n13. Set byte at offset 0xd to 0x01\\n14. Encode control flags and 0x00 into encoded format\\n15. Set final 3 bytes to 0xff and terminator to 0x00\\n\\nParameters:\\nmodeType (char, CL): Game state mode identifier (0x05, 0x06, or other)\\npGameStateData (void*): Pointer to source game state data to copy\\ncontrolFlags (ushort): Control/status flags to store (bit 0 always set to 1)\\n\\nReturns:\\nvoid\\n\\nSpecial Cases:\\n- Mode 0x05 and 0x06: Trigger flag bit 0x20 (render enabled)\\n- Magic value 0xaa55aa55 is buffer signature/header\\n- Size field 0x60 specifies buffer footprint\\n- Encoded sections use EncodeValueAsSignedBytes for 2-byte encoding\\n- Multiple sentinel blocks (0xffffffff and 0xff) indicate unused fields\\n- Final structure is approximately 212+ bytes\\n\\nStructure Layout:\\nOffset | Size | Field Name          | Type    | Description\\n-------|------|---------------------|---------|-------------------------------------------------------\\n0x0    | 4    | Magic               | uint    | Signature 0xaa55aa55\\n0x4    | 4    | Size                | uint    | Buffer size (0x60)\\n0x8    | 128  | StateData           | uint*4  | Copied game state (via CopyMemoryWithAlignment)\\n0x18   | 4    | Flags               | uint    | Control flags (input OR 0x1)\\n0x1c   | 1    | ModeType            | char    | Mode identifier from param\\n0x20   | 1    | InitFlag            | char    | Always 0x1\\n0x22   | 4    | TimeValue           | uint    | Result from __time32()\\n0x26   | 4    | Unknown1            | uint    | 0x14f\\n0x2a   | 1    | Field3              | char    | 0x10\\n0x2b   | 1    | Field4              | char    | 0x1e\\n0x2c   | 16   | ReferenceData       | uint*4  | Copy from 0x6fa64d9c-0x6fa64dac\\n0x3c   | 11   | DataArray           | char*11 | Copied from reference table\\n0x47   | 1    | ModeInc             | char    | modeType + 1\\n0x48   | 32   | Sentinels1          | uint*8  | 0xffffffff markers\\n0x68   | 9    | Sentinels2          | char*9  | 0xff markers\\n0x71   | 1    | Marker              | char    | 0x01\\n0x72   | 2    | Encoded1            | char*2  | Encoded flags value\\n0x74   | 2    | Encoded2            | char*2  | Encoded 0x00\\n0x76   | 3    | Sentinels3          | char*3  | 0xff markers\\n0x79   | 1    | Terminator          | char    | 0x00",
