      "name": "UpdateAndApplyConstraints",
      "signature": "void UpdateAndApplyConstraints(int valueOffset)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Updates a validated field value by applying a constraint offset and capping to maximum.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load context pointer from global state (ECX)\n2. Call ValidateAndGetNestedField() to validate and retrieve nested field value\n3. Add valueOffset parameter to the retrieved value (adjustment)\n4. Load context pointer again (ECX) for constraint application\n5. Call CapValueToMaximum() with adjusted value to apply upper bound constraint\n\nParameters:\n- valueOffset: Offset/adjustment value to add to the validated field\n\nReturns:\nNone (void) - Function updates global state and returns via __stdcall cleanup\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Global context loaded from 0x6fa65aa0\n- Result value adjustment uses stack parameter addition\n- Constraint capping applied after offset adjustment\n- Called 3 times from FUN_6fa4c010 in different game state update scenarios",
      "name_source": "LoD/PD2",
