      "name": "ValidateExpMpqAndClearUIControls",
      "signature": "int ValidateExpMpqAndClearUIControls(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Validates the Diablo II expansion MPQ and destroys all UI control objects.\n\nThis function ensures the D2 Expansion MPQ is accessible and valid, then safely\ndestroys all UI controls in the global control array by iterating through them\nand calling DestroyUIControl for each. The global control count is reset to zero\nafter all controls are destroyed.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call FindAndValidateD2ExpMpq to validate MPQ access\n2. If validation fails, skip control destruction and return success (1)\n3. Load the global UI control count from DAT_6fa65e34\n4. If control count is 0 or less, skip loop and proceed to cleanup\n5. Initialize loop index ESI to 0 and control pointer EDI to array start (DAT_6fa653c0)\n6. Loop: Call DestroyUIControl with current control pointer\n7. Increment loop index and advance control pointer by 4 bytes\n8. Compare loop index against control count and repeat until all controls destroyed\n9. Clear the global control count to 0\n10. Return 1 to indicate successful completion\n\nParameters:\n  None. Function accesses global UI control array and count.\n\nReturns:\n  1 - Always returns success (int) regardless of validation or destruction\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - If MPQ validation fails, control array is not destroyed (early exit)\n  - Control array is indexed by 4-byte pointers (stride of 4)\n  - All controls must be destroyed before UI shutdown\n  - Global control count is reset after all controls are destroyed\n\nStructure Layout:\n  Global UI Control Array at 0x6fa653c0:\n    Stride: 4 bytes per control\n    Type: Array of control pointers (undefined4)\n    \n  Global Control Count at 0x6fa65e34:\n    Type: 4-byte integer (dword)\n    Represents: Number of active UI controls",
      "name_source": "LoD/PD2",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:59efa046f8023d8ffd1feeda3d4152344ccc87e434e5598edca9c96373380e6a",
