      "name": "InitializeGameSession",
      "signature": "void InitializeGameSession(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Initializes the game session with core entities and configurations.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if initialization flag (DAT_6fa65ad4) is set to 1\n2. If not set, skip initialization and set completion flag then return\n3. If set, validate D2 MPQ files via FindAndValidateD2ExpMpq()\n4. If MPQ validation fails (returns non-zero), initialize game command sequence\n5. If MPQ validation succeeds (returns 0):\n   - Create and configure 6 game entities (types 0x73-0x78: Monsters, Urshak, Andariel, Radament, BloodRaven, Skeleton King, The Countess)\n   - Call SetCurrentEventTarget on first entity with parameter 1\n   - Call ModifyEntityBitFlags(0x1) on each entity to enable gameplay\n6. Dispatch initial command with parameters (0,0,0)\n7. Render text box with Unicode text\n8. Set entity parameter fields to 0\n9. Iterate through item configuration array (DAT_6fa65e74, DAT_6fa65e78):\n   - Load item pointer from array using itemIndex * 4 offset\n   - If pointer is null, get return address 0x1143 and abort with error message\n   - If item type is 0, break loop\n   - Render current item in UI control\n   - Compare item string with \"ProjectD2\" case-insensitively\n   - If strings match, clamp item index to valid range\n   - Increment itemIndex and continue loop\n10. Call CleanupGameResources()\n11. Set completion flag (DAT_6fa65984) to 1\n12. Return\n\nParameters:\nNone. Uses global state variables for all data.\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If DAT_6fa65ad4 is not 1, function skips all initialization and only sets completion flag\n- Null pointer in item array triggers fatal error abort with return address 0x1143\n- Magic numbers: Entity types 0x73-0x78 represent specific monster/unit types (Monsters, Urshak, Andariel, Radament, BloodRaven, Skeleton King)\n- String comparison uses \"ProjectD2\" as identifier, case-insensitive match triggers clamping\n\nStructure Layout (Game Entity Configuration):\nOffset | Size | Field Name         | Type      | Description\n0      | 4    | itemArrayPointer   | void*     | Pointer to item configuration array (DAT_6fa65e74)\n4      | 4    | itemArrayCount     | int       | Number of items in array (DAT_6fa65e78)\n8      | 4    | initFlag           | int       | Initialization flag (DAT_6fa65ad4), 1=run init\n12     | 4    | completionFlag     | int       | Completion flag (DAT_6fa65984), 1=initialization done",
      "name_source": "LoD/PD2",
