      "name": "ProcessInventoryInputCode",
      "signature": "int ProcessInventoryInputCode(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Processes inventory UI input codes (0x23-0x28) for slot navigation and display management. Manages current slot selection index (DAT_6fa64db0) and visible offset (DAT_6fa65ed4) with boundary constraints. Codes: 0x23=reset to end, 0x24=reset to start, 0x25=decrement by 1, 0x26=decrement by 2, 0x27=increment by 1, 0x28=increment by 2. Returns 1 for successful navigation or if no changes needed, 0 if input code is invalid (0x102).\\\"",
