      "name": "InitializeGameSessionAndLoadZone",
      "signature": "void InitializeGameSessionAndLoadZone(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Initializes game session by searching for matching zone data and loading appropriate resources.\n\nIterates through a linked list of session configurations to find an entry matching the current string hash and within the active time window. Once found, loads zone data and initializes BattleNet UI. If no matching session is found or handler indicates failure, dispatches command and initializes UI with fallback path. Returns after setting error flags if initialization fails.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Reset game state and audio configuration\n2. Compute hash of context string for session matching\n3. Get current system time for time-window validation\n4. Load session list head pointer from global storage\n5. Loop through linked list nodes:\n   a. Check if current node pointer is null (end of list)\n   b. Compare node hash with computed string hash\n   c. Validate node timestamp against current time\n   d. If match found, load zone data from node and initialize UI\n   e. If match not found, advance to next node via offset +0xc\n6. If no session found, call global state handler function\n7. Test handler result - if success (0), dispatch command and initialize UI\n8. If handler fails, set error flags and store context for later recovery\n9. Return to caller\n\nParameters:\nNone - uses global state: DAT_6fa65ef4 (session list), DAT_6fa656c4 (handler vtable)\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Magic number 0x6fa5c364: GetTickCount function address (time validation)\n- Magic number 0x68: Offset into handler vtable for query function\n- Magic number 0x6fa65eb8/0x6fa65ebc: Error state globals\n- Session nodes are 16-byte linked list structures with offsets:\n  +0x0: hash_string (dword)\n  +0x4: zone_data_path (pointer)\n  +0x8: expiry_time (dword)\n  +0xc: next_node (pointer)\n\nStructure Layout:\nOffset | Size | Field Name       | Type    | Description\n-------|------|------------------|---------|--------------------\n0x00   | 4    | hash_string      | dword   | Session identifier hash\n0x04   | 4    | zone_data        | void*   | Pointer to zone file path\n0x08   | 4    | expiry_time      | dword   | Session expiration timestamp\n0x0C   | 4    | next_node        | Node*   | Next session node pointer",
      "name_source": "LoD/PD2",
      "method": "NOP",
