      "name": "JoinGameWithSelectedCharacter",
      "signature": "int JoinGameWithSelectedCharacter(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Joins game with the selected character and connects to the specified realm.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Retrieves the selected character name from a linked list\n2. Converts character name from Unicode to UTF-8 format\n3. Initializes game state and rendering UI with loaded character\n4. Cleans up previous game resources\n5. Attempts to validate/initialize realm connection\n6. If validation succeeds, copies character data and initiates connection to preferred realm\n7. Resets game state and UI controls\n8. Returns success status\n\nParameters:\nNone - operates on global game state and selected character\n\nReturns:\n1 (always returns success; actual connection result stored in global state)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Connection failure silently skipped; function always returns 1\n- Magic value 0x7fffffff passed to memory copy (max size)\n- Realm connection handled by external function at 0x1018be10",
      "name_source": "LoD/PD2",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:b01752f642329f31c75d0c0ac97ed4ed52cfec742b10563f0803230a784e71ff",
