      "name": "InitializeGameEngine",
      "signature": "int InitializeGameEngine(void * this)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Initializes the game engine state and rendering subsystem.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load game state context pointer into EAX from address 0x6fa65758\n2. Call InitializeGameStateAndRenderUI() with the context as implicit this pointer\n3. Call ResetGameStateAndUIControls() to reset game state and UI elements\n4. Return 1 (success indicator)\n\nParameters:\nImplicit this pointer in ECX - Game engine context structure\n\nReturns:\n1 - Initialization successful\n\nNotes:\nThis function is the primary entry point for game engine initialization, \norchestrating both the render pipeline setup and game state reset. The context \npointer at 0x6fa65758 likely points to a global game engine or manager structure.",
