      "name": "InitializeMultiplayerGameSession",
      "signature": "int InitializeMultiplayerGameSession(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Initialize a multiplayer game session by validating the player's Unicode character name and applying game state updates. Manages the session linked list lookup, validates expansion availability, and configures UI components.\\n\\nAlgorithm:\\n1. Verify Diablo II expansion is available via FindAndValidateD2ExpMpq()\\n2. Iterate through game state linked list (0x6fa65ec8) to find matching session index (0x6fa64db0)\\n3. Check if session is already active using status flag at offset 0x324 (bit 0x20)\\n4. If active, return early; if inactive, proceed to validation\\n5. Check if player Unicode name exists at offset 0x100 (non-zero pointer with non-empty string)\\n6. If name missing, initialize new player session via FUN_6fa4f030() and setup UI\\n7. If name present, convert Unicode to Windows format into buffer [ESP+0x10]\\n8. Call ValidateAndApplyGameStateUpdate() to validate game state\\n9. If validation fails, check current game state via GetCurrentGameState()\\n10. If state is 0x7b, initialize two 512-element Unicode buffers, convert player name, format command string, and setup UI\\n11. Otherwise, setup UI with standard initialization callback and return\\n12. If validation succeeds, mark session active (set flag 0x20 at offset 0x324), render display, destroy UI controls\\n13. Call ModifyObjectBitfield() before returning success code 0x1\\n\\nParameters:\\nNone - operates on global game state pointers\\n\\nReturns:\\n1 on success (always returns 1 in all code paths)\\n\\nSpecial Cases:\\n- Magic offset 0x324: Player session status flags (bit 0x20 = active)\\n- Magic offset 0x100: Unicode character name pointer\\n- Magic offset 0x34c: Next player session in linked list\\n- State 0x7b: Special initialization with name formatting and command dispatch\\n- 0x6fa65ec8: Global head pointer to game state list\\n- 0x6fa64db0: Global current session index\\n- 0x6fa65eac: Session counter reset flag\\n\\nStructure Layout:\\nGame state structure accessed via ESI:\\n  Offset  Size  Field          Type       Description\\n  0x100   4     pName          Unicode*   Player character name (Unicode string)\\n  0x324   1     flags          byte       Status flags (bit 0x20 = active)\\n  0x34c   4     pNext          GameState* Pointer to next session in linked list\\\"",
      "name_source": "LoD/PD2",
