      "name": "InitializeBattleNetConnection",
      "signature": "uint InitializeBattleNetConnection(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Initializes BattleNet UI controls and configures realm selection.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if initialization flag is set (DAT_6fa65ad4 == 1)\n2. Initialize rendering system if initialization needed\n3. Load current realm state from DAT_6fa65e78\n4. If realm == -1: Handle disconnect state\n   - Clear disconnect flags at offset 0x35d and 0x37d in game context\n   - Dispatch callback for disconnection\n   - Call virtual function at offset 0x10 in DAT_6fa656c4\n   - Initialize BattleNet UI with callback InitializeGameSession\n5. If realm == 0: Call FUN_6fa4e250 initialization routine\n   - Initialize BattleNet UI with callback InitializeGameSession\n6. If realm > 0: Configure preferred realm\n   - Enqueue multiple game commands (0x7a, 0x94, 0x95, 0x69, 0x6b, 0x6c)\n   - Search for preferred realm in string list \"Diablo II\"\n   - If found: Return success (1)\n   - If not found: Query gateway for available realms\n     - Get realm name from gateway using virtual offset 0x98\n     - Copy realm data to buffer at 0x6fa65758\n     - Store new preferred realm using func_0x1018be10\n     - Search again for preferred realm\n     - If still not found: Use default realm (index 0x7fffffff)\n\nReturns:\n0: Initialization incomplete or BattleNet mode disabled\n1: Initialization successful or configuration completed\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- BattleNet connection state stored in global DAT_6fa65e78\n- Realm == -1 indicates disconnect/reconnect needed\n- Realm == 0 indicates initial session setup\n- Realm > 0 indicates active realm selection mode\n- Multiple global buffers used for realm storage (0x6fa65758, 0x6fa5e204, 0x6fa5dc80)\n- Virtual function dispatch used for gateway interaction through DAT_6fa656c4\n\nStructure Layout:\nGateway context structure at DAT_6fa656c4:\n  Offset 0x10: Virtual function pointer for cleanup/disconnect\n  Offset 0x98: Virtual function pointer for gateway realm query",
      "name_source": "LoD/PD2",
