      "name": "ProcessEntityDisplayState",
      "signature": "void ProcessEntityDisplayState(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Processes entity display state and rendering properties\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize state flags: local_220=0x25 (property id), local_21c=offset adjustment\n2. Loop through DAT_6fa64dbc items: call ClearResourceState(), initialize_system_state()\n3. Switch on initialization state (cases 6,7,9,10 map to error codes), call SetEntityParameterFields\n4. Check display conditions: DAT_6fa65ad4, DAT_6fa65eb8 conditions determine processing path\n5. Iterate through entity linked list starting at DAT_6fa65ec8 (pointer chain at offset 0x34c)\n6. For each entity: validate slot index against DAT_6fa65ed4 bounds\n7. If valid: set object properties, calculate flags from bit masks (offsets 0x324 for flags)\n8. Handle two property types: type 2 (dispatch single command) vs type 0 (format text output)\n9. For type 0: concatenate strings, calculate skill tier, format Unicode output\n10. Check time constraints (offset 0x348), calculate day delta, validate against threshold 0x3c\n11. Render formatted text boxes with calculated properties, toggle property IDs between 0x25/0x135\n12. Continue until entity pointer becomes NULL\n\nParameters: void (uses global state variables and linked data structures)\n\nReturns: void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If entity slot out of range: call StoreValueWithValidation with 0 (clear property)\n- Time delta calculation uses 32-bit division by 0x15180 (milliseconds to days conversion)\n- Property ID alternates: 0x25 on even iterations, 0x135 on odd (offset alternates by 0x5d)\n- Bit mask operations: offset 0x324 accessed for flags, offset 0x322 for index value\n- Magic numbers: 0x2b3b (property type 2 dispatch), 0x2b7e/0x2b7c/0x2b7d (tier dispatch values)\n- Zero-initialized Unicode arrays: 100-element and 10-element arrays for string buffers",
