      "name": "ValidateGameEntityAndInitializeState",
      "signature": "int ValidateGameEntityAndInitializeState(int * pEntityId)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Validates a game entity against known lists and initializes game state if conditions are met.\n\nALGORITHM:\n1. Check if game state is already initialized (DAT_6fa65984); return 1 if true\n2. Load current state value and initialize search index to 0\n3. Validate entity ID (first param) against two global entity lists:\n   - Loop through indices 0 to DAT_6fa64dbc\n   - Check if entity matches DAT_6fa65858[index] or DAT_6fa65734[index]\n   - Exit loop early if match found or validation fails\n4. Validate entity index is within bounds (DAT_6fa65ed4 + index <= DAT_6fa65ed0)\n   - Return 0 if bounds check fails\n5. Update DAT_6fa64db0 with calculated value (DAT_6fa65ed4 + index)\n   - Set to -1 if DAT_6fa65ed0 < 1\n6. Check if special mode 0x201 is active (param[1] == 0x201):\n   - If yes: Get current tick count and validate timing/state conditions\n   - If current state unchanged and time delta < 500ms: call ProcessGameStateAndInitialize()\n   - Otherwise: Update tick count and call InitializeEntityCharacterAndRenderUI()\n   - If no: Always call InitializeEntityCharacterAndRenderUI()\n7. Return status code from initialization function\n\nPARAMETERS:\npEntityId (int *): Pointer to entity identifier to validate against game entity lists\n\nRETURNS:\nint: 1 for success/initialization performed, 0 if entity validation or bounds check fails\n\nSPECIAL CASES:\n- Early return (1) if game already initialized (DAT_6fa65984 != 0)\n- Entity validation timeout: 500ms throttle via GetTickCount() prevents rapid reinitializations\n- State value -1 indicates resource clearing state (DAT_6fa65ed0 < 1)\n- Mode 0x201 triggers state-aware initialization path; other modes use standard UI initialization\n\nGLOBAL STATE DEPENDENCIES:\nDAT_6fa65984: Game initialized flag\nDAT_6fa64db0: Current state value\nDAT_6fa64dbc: Entity list count\nDAT_6fa65858: Primary entity list address\nDAT_6fa65734: Secondary entity list address\nDAT_6fa65ed0: Max entity count\nDAT_6fa65ed4: Entity base offset\nDAT_6fa65ef8: Last tick count timestamp",
      "name_source": "LoD/PD2",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:4d655578b6fd4c203c01b2dea9c19a2a",
