      "name": "CheckAndModifyEntityState",
      "signature": "int CheckAndModifyEntityState(int * pEntityState)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Checks entity state flag and conditionally modifies entity bit flags.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Retrieve entity pointer from stack argument (stdcall parameter)\n2. Load state value from entity structure at offset +0xc\n3. Test if state value is non-zero\n4. Call ModifyEntityStateBitFlags with EDX=1 if state is non-zero, or EDX=0 if state is zero\n5. Always return 1 (success status code)\n\nParameters:\npEntityState (int*): Pointer to entity structure; accessed field at offset +0xc contains entity state flags\n\nReturns:\nint: Always returns 1 (success status)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Both code paths call ModifyEntityStateBitFlags but with different EDX flag values\n- The state check at offset +0xc determines the modification behavior\n- Return value is constant regardless of input, suggesting operation always succeeds\n\nStructure Layout:\nOffset | Size | Field Name | Type | Description\n0x0    | 4    | field_0    | int  | Unknown field\n0x4    | 4    | field_4    | int  | Unknown field\n0x8    | 4    | field_8    | int  | Unknown field\n0xc    | 4    | state      | int  | State flags determining modification behavior",
