      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Initializes the game state to a specific configuration value.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Set the game state variable (at 0x6fa65ad4) to 2\n2. Call the state configuration function (FUN_6fa57b30) to apply state changes\n3. Return success indicator (1)\n\nReturns:\n  1 - Always returns 1 to indicate successful initialization\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - The function writes a fixed state value of 2 to the global configuration\n  - No validation is performed on the result of FUN_6fa57b30\n  - This appears to be a simple initialization wrapper",
