      "comment": "Initializes the game startup sequence by setting game state flag and invoking main initialization routine.\\n\\nAlgorithm:\\n1. Set game state flag (DAT_6fa65ad4) to 3 to indicate initialization in progress\\n2. Call FUN_6fa59290 to perform core game initialization including command processing and resource loading\\n3. Return success status (1)\\n\\nReturns:\\n- 1: Initialization successful\\n\\nSpecial Cases:\\n- The return value is always 1; error conditions are handled within the called initialization function\\n- The game state flag value of 3 is a sentinel indicating the initialization phase",
