      "signature": "void InitializeGameTimeHash(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Initializes the game time hash value used for timing operations.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call ComputeStringHash with \"Game_Time\" string constant\n2. Store the computed hash value in global variable DAT_6fa65f00\n3. Return to caller\n\nPurpose:\nThis function computes and caches a hash of the \"Game_Time\" string identifier, storing the result in a global variable. This cached hash is likely used by other game systems to quickly reference timing-related functionality without repeatedly computing the hash.\n\nReturns:\nvoid (no return value)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- The string \"Game_Time\" is a fixed string constant at address 0x6fa5ea04\n- Hash is stored at global address 0x6fa65f00 for use by other modules",
